WEBVTT

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:15.320
They're not actively attacking Nortrum.

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:17.160
That's deliberate on their part.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:23.210
The enemy is probably trying to capture Nortrum unharmed, not destroy it.

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:26.630
That means Nortrum can defend itself{ its defense forces can manage by themselves,}

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:30.050
while we concentrate our strength on the enemy fortress.

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:31.170
Yes.

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:35.970
But the enemy might have a bolder plan in mind. Namely...

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:38.890
Linking up with Nortrum.

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:44.560
If the orbit they're taking is to prepare for docking, it all makes sense.

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:45.560
We need to hurry!

00:00:55.200 --> 00:01:01.200
ai ja nai sawarenai

00:00:55.200 --> 00:01:01.200
It's not love; I can't touch you

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:06.920
tada hakanai negai deshita

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:06.920
I just had harbored some fleeting wishes

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:12.630
kimi dake sore dake

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:12.630
Wishes about you, no more

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:18.140
mitsumeteita hikari deshita

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:18.140
I stared at the light that was you

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:23.100
ima unmei wo hamidashite

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:23.100
Now we break free of fate

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:29.560
sutorobo no toki ga kimi wo sarau mae ni sa

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:29.560
before a time of uncertainty blows you far away

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:34.530
motto hayaku kakenuketeyuku

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:34.530
We will go faster than ever before

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:39.160
ano hoshi ni naritai

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:39.160
I want to be your star

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:45.290
maboroshi demo ii

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:45.290
I don't mind if I can never become it

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:52.130
oikakete chiri ni naru made

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:52.130
It's my goal until I turn to dust

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:57.430
ima ginga wo matataite

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:57.430
Now I shine onto the galaxy

00:01:57.430 --> 00:02:03.890
monokuro no yume ga boku wo sasou mae ni sa

00:01:57.430 --> 00:02:03.890
before despair sneaks into my dreams and hopes

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:08.850
konya mayowazu ni mune wo saku

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:08.850
Tonight we act without hesitation, without regard for others

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:14.530
ano hoshi ni naritai

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:14.530
I want to be your star

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:26.620
Episode 27 
I Saw a Red Sunset

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:31.210
Robert and Cole teams, engage the enemy's guard mobile suits.

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:51.560
Remaining forces are to temporarily fall back and enter assault formation!

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:18.710
The enemy's defenses are strong.

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:22.390
So it's impossible to destroy the system that stopped the photon ring ray?

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:23.680
In that case...

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:28.810
All members of the Woolf team!

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:30.730
<i>This is Flit Asuno.</i>

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:33.060
Commander Asuno?

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:34.610
What is it?

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:36.940
<i>I'll be commanding you from now on.</i>

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:38.150
<i>Assemble on my position at once!</i>

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:39.650
Yes, sir!

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:03.510
That's Zeheart!

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:05.390
Asemu!

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:09.430
No matter who the enemy is, I'm going to fight!

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:25.200
He's so fast!

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.530
He's not supposed to be an X-Rounder!

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:29.870
You're going down!

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:37.420
I'll defeat you and protect everyone!

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:40.460
You'll never be a true warrior, so you'll never defeat me!{I can't be defeated! Not by you, who can never be a true warrior!}

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:41.880
I'm different now!

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:46.800
You're all gonna die here, cannon fodder! {pawns/lackeys}

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:48.970
Take this!

00:04:57.150 --> 00:04:58.690
Don't lose your cool!

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:00.940
I'm not as responsible as you are, Commander!

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.360
Mink!

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:07.070
Electromagnetic terminals now deploying to designated orbit!

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:09.490
We won't get many chances.

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:12.540
We can only fire one or two more times.

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:14.660
How long until they're fully deployed?

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:16.580
15 minutes.

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:20.250
We can change our line of fire and try again, but it'll still...

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:22.880
Commander Asuno is our only hope.

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.130
Enemy machines in our line of fire!

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:27.680
They must be planning to attack the terminals!

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:29.800
Send mobile suits over there!

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.430
Protect it, no matter what!

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:45.440
<i>My guess is that's part of the fortress's attitude control system.{>attitude}{correct}</i>

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:46.360
<i>It's huge.</i>

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:50.780
<i>The fortress turned itself around to block that attack.</i>

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:54.870
In other words its defenses are unidirectional.

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:57.920
To land a hit, we have to take out its attitude control!

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:58.750
That's right.

00:05:58.750 --> 00:05:59.710
I see.

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:00.750
Let's do it!

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:11.430
There's no time!

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:14.060
I'll use the Zefuld{the WHAT? check} Launcher.{YEP.}

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:15.350
You take care of the nearby enemies!

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:18.350
We just need to draw them away, right?

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:20.940
We'll do it!

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:22.060
Somehow!

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:38.870
I did it!

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:42.210
Take this, Vagan!

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:58.140
<i>The fortress can no longer move.</i>

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.140
<i>Now we can damage it.</i>

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:00.810
<i>Hurry!</i>

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:03.690
Captain, fire the photon blaster guide beam!

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:04.860
Please wait!

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:06.480
What is it?

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:08.900
The enemy fortress is turning rapidly!

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:11.570
It's possible it might block our attack!

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:13.490
What?

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:16.370
What's going on?

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:34.470
Impossible! They're using the 
mobile suits' thrusters to turn it?!

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:41.890
Gundam, I know I can't match you.

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:45.190
But if I set the Mu-szell to full power...!

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:54.370
Is he sacrificing himself?

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:11.720
Is that all? I can still...!

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:31.820
Master Zeheart, lead Vagan to the future!

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:37.740
Da{i}z!

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:48.630
I'll do it anyway!

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:50.500
I must!

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:59.220
<i>Commander Asuno! Are you okay?</i>

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:01.890
Yes. I'll return to the Diva for now.

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:04.730
You regroup and get back to the front lines!

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:05.520
<i>Roger!</i>

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:15.360
We can't keep defending the photon ring ray!

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:17.200
We won't last much longer!

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:21.120
Captain! Cancel the firing sequence of the photon ring ray!

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:23.040
But at this rate...

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:24.460
I have an idea.

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:29.790
Let me set a target for the photon blaster, instead of the photon ring ray.

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:32.210
Very well.

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:33.840
I'll take responsibility.

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:36.220
Sergeant Elle, give him your seat.

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:38.970
Yes, ma'am.

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:45.180
Attention, all mobile suits! Withdraw from the line of fire!

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:47.390
Input complete!

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:50.060
Photon blaster, fire!

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:11.840
Interference screen has shut down!

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:15.130
The collision has badly damaged our propulsion system!

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:26.850
While the enemy mobile suits retreat, have ours pull back from the fortress.

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:28.850
Await further orders!

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:31.610
We managed somehow...

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:33.570
Commander, look at this!

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:37.490
The enemy fortress's propulsion system has completely shut down!

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:40.200
At this rate, it'll collide with Nortrum!

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:41.870
That's ridiculous!

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:45.540
Have the Nortrum government order an emergency evacuation!

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:47.750
Commander Asuno!

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:49.710
I'm aware of the situation.

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:52.670
The enemy fortress has lost its shield.

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:55.130
This time, we can destroy it with the photon ring ray!

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:59.550
But the damage from multiple shots could disable the navigation.

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:02.470
If we don't do it, Nortrum will be destroyed.

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:04.430
We don't have a choice!

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:08.760
{eyecatch}

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:18.150
Now! Fire!

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:20.400
Photon blaster, fire guide beam!

00:11:39.470 --> 00:11:41.180
We don't have enough power!

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:44.550
Diva engines switching to post-firing output tuning mode.

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:46.430
Enemy fortress is slowing down.

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:49.310
It's veering off of its collision course with Nortrum...

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:52.270
It-It's heading toward this ship!

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:54.190
Emergency evasive to port!

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:56.570
All hands, brace for impact!

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:20.970
At this rate, this ship and the fortress will enter the atmosphere!{ we'll enter the atmosphere along with the fortress!}

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:24.390
If it falls to Earth, massive damage will be unavoidable!

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:26.430
First, we'll get away from the fortress!

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:29.810
Then we'll use the full strength of the fleet against it!

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:34.230
No change!

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:38.570
Then we'll have to use the photon blaster again to make an opening!

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:39.690
It's no good!

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:41.690
Part of the firing system is damaged!

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:45.610
Unless we replace the resonance control unit on the side of the barrel...

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:46.740
Get started now!

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:54.000
Replace the unit? We don't have enough people down here!

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:56.580
Okay, I'll do it!

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:58.630
<i>But then the AGE—</i>

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:00.920
Hold on!

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:02.010
I heard the situation.

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:03.920
I'll do it!

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:17.690
180 minutes until atmospheric entry.

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:22.030
Replacement complete!

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:23.320
Now we can—

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:29.320
You killed my comrades!

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:30.950
You're not going down that easy!

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:36.120
What?

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:37.460
You're in the way! Move!

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:43.630
Remi!

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:44.630
Damn you!

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:49.640
Photon blaster, fire!

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:10.870
Okay, found you!

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.040
<i>Mr. Obright...</i>

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:15.160
Remi, just hold on!

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:16.250
I'm coming for you!

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:21.670
<i>I guess... I won't be going home.</i>

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:22.960
What?

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:24.420
What did you say?

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:25.090
You can't mean...!

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:30.510
I wanted to make a family with you, Mr. Obright.

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:35.680
Because... I was alone.

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:38.100
Hey, wait!

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:40.150
The Diva's our home, right?

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:42.610
We're going back together!

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:48.780
That's right.

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:54.200
It's our home... isn't it?

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:58.620
Get home safely, okay?

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:01.170
Promise me.{she turned off}

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:08.510
Remi!

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:17.020
Remi...

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:21.440
Remi!

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:26.070
It's falling...

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:27.940
What's happening?

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:30.860
This is...

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:35.030
Asemu?

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:37.910
At this rate, the Earth will be...

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:40.870
A message from Asemu!

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:43.330
<i>Commander! There's still a way!</i>

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:44.040
What?

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:48.010
<i>I'll break into the enemy fortress and detonate the energy core.</i>

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:51.550
<i>If I'm successful, I'll destroy it before it hits the atmosphere.</i>

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:53.970
But there isn't time...

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:57.140
You can't be...

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:03.900
Please listen to me.

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:06.650
As I am now, I can save everyone.

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:08.980
No, I'm the only one who can.

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:10.440
<i>But...!</i>

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:12.990
Come back, Asemu!

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:14.870
<i>Romary...</i>

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:20.290
I lost sight of what I was fighting for until now.

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:24.420
<i>My head was filled with impatience and jealousy.</i>

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:27.500
<i>But I'm not confused any more.</i>

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:29.710
<i>I just want to protect everyone.</i>

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:32.010
So please let me go.

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:34.380
Dad... Romary...

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:36.550
Asemu. {LET'S ALL SAY NAMES NOW KTHX}

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:37.720
No, don't go! {IF YOU DIE, WE CAN'T HAVE A THREESOME WITH ZEHEART}

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:39.390
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:16:39.770 --> 00:16:40.640
Asemu!

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:48.480
<i>Master Zeheart! I'm sorry, but at this rate,</i>

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:51.320
Downes will do enormous damage to Earth!

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:52.440
<i>I know.</i>

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:54.030
<i>We'll have to switch to the backup plan.</i>

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:54.990
But...

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:57.370
The fortress's self-destruct system is uncontrollable!

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:59.160
<i>Then I'll figure something out.</i>

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:02.160
Surely you don't plan to destroy the energy core yourself...

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:04.120
We have no choice.

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:07.920
We'll get those landing capsules to Earth as per the backup plan.

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:14.380
We need to hide them among the fragments when the fortress explodes, so they'll fall to Earth.

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:15.680
Don't mess up the timing.{that means you, merines}

00:17:16.220 --> 00:17:16.970
<i>Yes, sir.</i>

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:17.970
<i>Please leave it to me.</i>

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:18.970
I'm counting on you.

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:22.560
Earth is to be our Eden.

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:24.020
I will save it.

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:30.360
There's no need to restrain it anymore.

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:34.150
I'll use my X-Rounder power to the fullest!

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:42.490
Zeheart?

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:43.660
<i>Asemu?</i>

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:45.870
<i>Are you planning to destroy this fortress from the inside?</i>

00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:47.040
<i>Yes.</i>

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:49.080
<i>I won't let you stop me.</i>

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:51.710
But the interior gets more complex the further in you go.

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:53.260
You won't have time to figure it out.

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:54.340
<i>I know.</i>

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:56.300
So what are you going to do?

00:17:57.260 --> 00:18:00.510
I'll destroy the energy core, even if 
I have to ram it with the Gundam!

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:04.020
That won't work!

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:05.640
We'll use the colony destroyers!

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:06.600
Follow me!

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:07.600
Zeheart?

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:20.370
This is the energy core?

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:21.240
Yes.

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:22.910
I'll show you the detonation point.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:29.420
<i>This operation cannot possibly fail.</i>

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:33.670
So this was Lord Ezelcant's plan all along?

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:35.090
No, it couldn't be...

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:49.480
I didn't think we'd ever work together again.

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:50.850
Same here.

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:02.320
I've been fighting for so long...

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:04.120
As a Vagan warrior.

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:07.750
To make our wish come true.

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:10.670
But it wasn't enough.

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:15.090
In the end, there's very little you can do by yourself.

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:17.380
That's not true.

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:20.010
Haven't you saved a lot of lives?

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:25.010
No. I wanted to protect the land destined to be our Eden.{who's gonna be ur Eve, mr. adam lololo}

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:26.430
Earth.

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:28.850
The Earth is your Eden?

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:31.310
I was determined to create an Eden.

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:34.770
Where we don't have to fear disease, or kill each other in war.

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:36.270
A utopia.

00:19:37.230 --> 00:19:40.110
Is that why you fight?

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:42.860
I didn't know why I was fighting.

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:47.990
All I had was a jealous desire to catch up to you and my father.

00:19:47.990 --> 00:19:49.700
But you're here now.

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:52.330
For the people you want to protect...

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:53.630
You're risking your life for them.

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:56.040
You're a warrior, too.

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:58.590
A warrior...?

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:05.180
What?

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:08.350
<i>You still have much to do.</i>

